abstract: "Windows desktop application for quantum error correction research and evaluation. QECTOR Decoder Workbench v1.0.1 bundles the qector-decoder-v3 1.0.0 Rust/PyO3 backend, 17 decoder algorithms, 10 code families, a graphical interface, command-line entry points, and an 85-tool Model Context Protocol server for local stdio workflows."
